ces of A-H shares and average shares of shareholders are different statistically. Besides, the individual traders are dominant in the A-share market while the institutions are dominant in the H-share market. The most important result of our research is that uncertainty of information play a crucial role in the PEAD of segmented markets. No matter what types of traders are in the segmented markets, the uncertainty of information can efficiently magnify PEAD.<\/jats:p>","DOI":"10.2139\/ssrn.1652700","type":"posted-content","created":{"date-parts":[[2012,1,4]],"date-time":"2012-01-04T20:51:11Z","timestamp":1325710271000},"source":"Crossref","is-referenced-by-count":1,"title":["Uncertainty of Information, Reaction of Investors and Post-Earnings Announcement Drift: Some Empirical Evidences from A-H Share Markets of China"],"prefix":"10.2139","author":[{"given":"Jing","family":"Lu","sequence":"first","affiliation":[],"role":[{"vocabulary":"crossref","role":"author"}]}],"member":"78","reference":[{"key":"ref1","doi-asserted-by":"publisher","DOI":"10.2307\/3178121","volume":"603800000","year":"1996","journal-title":"Jingwei Texile Machinery Company Limited"},{"key":"ref2","first-page":"1996","volume":"719","journal-title":"Shangdong Xinhua Pharmaceutical Company Limited 457310000 000756 1993-9-30 76150000"},{"key":"ref3","doi-asserted-by":"publisher","first-page":"898","DOI":"10.1177\/0256090919970106","volume":"2962990000","journal-title":"Angang New Steel Company Limited"},{"key":"ref4","article-title":"Guangdong Kelon Electrical Holdings Co","year":"1996","journal-title":"Ltd"},{"key":"ref5","year":"2002","journal-title":"Anhui Expressway Company Limited"},{"key":"ref6","doi-asserted-by":"publisher","first-page":"2002","DOI":"10.1177\/0256090920020108","volume":"3326000000","journal-title":"China Shipping Development Company Limited"},{"key":"ref7","year":"2000","journal-title":"China Petroleum and Chemical Corporation"},{"key":"ref8","doi-asserted-by":"publisher","first